<title>USA: Iron Mountain names John Kenny Jr CFO.</title>
<headline>Iron Mountain names John Kenny Jr CFO.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iron Mountain Inc said Tuesday it named John Kenny Jr. as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Kenny succeeds Eugene Doggett, who will remain with the company as executive vice president focusing on strategic planning and investor relations, the company said.</p>
<p>Kenny was previously vice president of corporate development.</p>
